You start off getting molested by bandit scum and getting taken to their raep dungeon, and before you know it, irl hours have gone by and you're buying bread for your princess wife's party. Game of the year, all years.
Pros:
- Mounts;
- Blades;
- Seiges;
- 300 point headshots;
- Razing caravans, herding towns, robbing cattle;
- More seiges;
- Dedicating tournament victories to m'ladies.
Cons:
- M'ladies are all ugly because the game is old;
- Your nobility is greedy, their nobility are ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥s;
- No one told me you could order your troops around with F-keys;
- Getting your teeth kicked in by a group of peasants because you're bad at the game;
- Your physical irl body needs sustenance to survive, so you can't play 24/7 as you want to.

